      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انجدل</span></b>  <i>He fell down upon the ground:</i>
(S:) <i>he became thrown down upon the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَدَالَة</span>,
i. e., the <i>ground;</i> and in like manner ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجدّل</span></b> , <i>he
became thrown down,</i> &amp;c., <i>much,</i> or <i>often.</i> (TA.)

